# thedev-machines: ssh hosts probed by thedev-status (1 per line, # = comment).
# Copy this file to 'thedev-machines' and put YOUR machines in it. The local one is always included.
# The FIRST line is the default server for `srv` (override: SRV_HOST=…).
# Without this file, thedev stays purely local: no cross-machine board, no `srv`.
# my-server
# other-machine
